{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41226","headline":"梁郊祀乐章 庆顺 · 赵光逢","name":"梁郊祀乐章 庆顺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣皇戾止，天步舒迟。\n乾乾睿相，穆穆皇仪。\n进退必肃，陟降是祗。\n六变克协，万灵协随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵光逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}